# Ignore everything by default, then allow only what the site actually serves.
# Rationale: the raw source material in assets/ is ~530 MB and one file exceeds
# GitHub's 100 MB hard limit. Only the compressed derivatives get published.

*

!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!README.md
!CNAME

# GitHub Pages ALWAYS serves index.html at the site root. You cannot make a
# differently-named file the homepage by editing this file. To change designs,
# copy the variant OVER index.html. index.html must stay tracked.
!index.html

# Design variants — kept on disk for reference, never published.
index-dark.html
index-light.html
index-robot.html

# Local working notes — these name the unannounced project codename and must
# NOT reach a public repo. Keep them on disk, keep them out of git.
#   DEPLOY.md  CONTENT_NEEDED.md  MAINTENANCE.md

!assets/
assets/*
!assets/Ankit_Mehta_CV.pdf

!assets/img/
!assets/img/**
!assets/video/
!assets/video/**
!assets/slides/
!assets/slides/**

# Raw drops that landed inside assets/img|video/ — sources, not deliverables
assets/video/thesis_model_new.mp4
assets/video/thesis_bridge.mp4
assets/img/new_heashot.jpeg

# Figures cut in the rewrite. Nothing links to them; keep them off the wire.
assets/img/figures/iva_cleancomparison.jpg
assets/img/figures/iva_features.jpg
assets/img/figures/swarm_belief_log.jpg
assets/img/figures/thesis_bridge.jpg

# Never publish: raw recordings, source slides, unedited photos, brand kits
assets/*.mp4
assets/IVA_LAB_Slides/
assets/hobbies/
assets/logos/
assets/cradle_project_writeup.md

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
